FileNames (/usr/local/google/home/tinagao/WebstormProjects/caretaker/material2/node_modules/@angular/compiler-cli/src/transformers/program.js:496:82)\r\n    at TsCompilerAotCompilerTypeCheckHostAdapter.getSourceFile (/usr/local/google/home/tinagao/WebstormProjects/caretaker/material2/node_modules/@angular/compiler-cli/src/transformers/compiler_host.js:327:55)\r\n    at findSourceFile (/usr/local/google/home/tinagao/WebstormProjects/caretaker/material2/node_modules/typescript/lib/typescript.js:70246:29)\r\n    at processImportedModules (/usr/local/google/home/tinagao/WebstormProjects/caretaker/material2/node_modules/typescript/lib/typescript.js:70393:25)\r\n    at findSourceFile (/usr/local/google/home/tinagao/WebstormProjects/caretaker/material2/node_modules/typescript/lib/typescript.js:70274:17)\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\nThe build should work\r\n<!-- Describe what the desired behavior would be. -->\r\n\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\n1. Patch PR: https://github.com/angular/material2/pull/6018\r\n2. run `npm install`\r\n3. run `npm run demo-app`\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nFor bug reports please provide the *STEPS TO REPRODUCE* and if possible a *MINIMAL DEMO* of the problem via\r\nhttps://plnkr.co or similar (you can use this template as a starting point: http://plnkr.co/edit/tpl:AvJOMERrnz94ekVua0u5).\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\n<!-- Describe the motivation or the concrete use case. -->\r\n\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nAngular version: 5.0.0\r\n<!-- Check whether this is still an issue in the most recent Angular version -->\r\n\r\nBrowser:\r\n- [ ] Chrome (desktop) version XX\r\n- [ ] Chrome (Android) version XX\r\n- [ ] Chrome (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] Firefox version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (desktop) version XX\r\n- [ ] Safari (iOS) version XX\r\n- [ ] IE version XX\r\n- [ ] Edge version XX\r\n \r\nFor Tooling issues:\r\n- Node version: 6.9.5\r\n- Platform:  Linu